+	  Record how far a secondary CPU gets on its way into the kernel,
+	  in the early boot status word that is written with the MMU off,
+	  together with its MPIDR, MIDR, exception level, CTR_EL0 and the
+	  ID registers that decide whether it can run this kernel (PFR0/1,
+	  ISAR0/1/2, MMFR0/1/2, DFR0). The record is cleared before each
